              <span id="alg1.l22.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#800080;"> <span id="alg1.l22.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">key=lambda z:z[1], ’desc’)</span></span>

</div>
