<div id="A3.SS1.p5" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.SS1.p5.1" class="ltx_p">The dataset is significantly larger than the error-annotated subset of FEDI <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite"><a href="#bib.bib33" title="" class="ltx_ref">Petrak et al. (2024)</a></cite>, but its distribution across error types demonstrates analogous heterogeneity.</p>
</div>
