<span id="A3.T9.2.1.6.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:138.0pt;">
<span id="A3.T9.2.1.6.3.1.1" class="ltx_p">Ignore, Partner Contradiction, Incorrect Fact, Commonsense Contradiction</span>
</span></td>
