<section id="A4" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix D </span>Additional Analysis</h2>

<section id="A4.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">D.1 </span>Margin Parameter Experiments</h3>

<div id="A4.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.SS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We conducted a series of closed-world experiments using SEEED to identify the most effective value for the margin parameter <math id="A4.SS1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="m" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>m</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">m</annotation></semantics></math> in the Soft Nearest Neighbor Loss <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite"><a href="#bib.bib9" title="" class="ltx_ref">Frosst et al. (2019)</a></cite>. The experiments utilized dialogue contexts and corresponding summaries as input data. For the purpose of isolating the effects of the loss function, SEEED was reduced to its core joint loss component, with LBSR and NNK-Means <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite"><a href="#bib.bib37" title="" class="ltx_ref">Shekkizhar and Ortega (2022)</a></cite> disabled.</p>
</div>
